{
  "_doc": "Tier-2 small-town clinic on Route 9 north of Pell's Crossing (region D6, feature tamsin_clinic). Front (+Z) faces the highway. Route: parking lot, Cordon Medical's screening barriers -> front doors chained shut and papered with the quarantine notice -> round the west side to a smashed waiting-room window -> waiting room (the patients still waiting) -> vault the reception counter -> back hall -> stairs up (the landing boards groan: walk them upright and the ward wakes) to Cordon Medical's isolation ward (the nurse's body with the drug-closet key: taking it wakes the ward; a rotten floor drops into x-ray) -> nurse station (the directive) -> back down -> x-ray room (Patient 1's films on the lightbox) -> records (Dr. Voss and her log) -> drug closet, unlocked with the nurse's key (gate; the orderly's shotgun is wired to the door) -> loot: supply cabinets and the narcotics safe (same key); an orderly guards it -> ambulance entry -> unbolt the back door to the ambulance bay. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
